></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint, slide, dash, double jump around the map with AWM (Advance Waifu Mobility) in maps designed for high-speed navigation and vertical traversal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/f17a987bf8d40168c9e2c7b1071ad52f.avif?t=1761055718\" width=800 height=355 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d79a86ec7d5beaac77a314ed7b845e24.poster.avif?t=1761055718\" width=640 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d79a86ec7d5beaac77a314ed7b845e24.webm?t=1761055718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/d79a86ec7d5beaac77a314ed7b845e24.mp4?t=1761055718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AAA net code with regional dedicated servers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for 60+ FPS on low-spec devices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No intrusive live service bloat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/0b17c1ee57033f7af41fb8365303fcfd.avif?t=1761055718\" width=800 height=207 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/98e4bac064005a9650c7aac0d88c6236.poster.avif?t=1761055718\" width=640 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353050/extras/98e4bac064005a9650c7aac0d88c6236.webm?t=1761055718\" type=\"video/webm; code